    "updated_at": "2016-01-15T09:39:36Z",
    "body": "It seems to me this is not so different from other aspects of media that might not be supported but can’t be expressed in the MIME type. But certainly http://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/vnd.apple.mpegurl could be changed to support a version parameter, or some such. That seems out of scope for the HTML spec though.\n\ncc @dwsinger\n",
