    "updated_at": "2016-01-15T17:05:40Z",
    "body": "Wouldn't this be handled at the `.m3u8` playlist level? I see something about `EXT-X-VERSION` here: https://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-pantos-http-live-streaming-18#section-4.3.1.2\n\nAFAIK, most HLS usage I've encountered in the wild is `<video src=\"foo.m3u8\"></video>`\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
